{"2787680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Candy Rangers", "steam_appid": 2787680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Olympus Rangers: The new era of creature battles begins now!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/383a0867fc0731dab7adeeb3f0d90c23.avif?t=1783521917\" width=600 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>👉 olympus-rangers .com 👈</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Battle Revolution has arrived!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let the battle begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JanduSoft and Mechano are pleased to announce Olympus Rangers, a new turn-based strategic creature battle simulator coming to Steam later this year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/56c0676406dcdaddf7930ee5ff5864dc.avif?t=1783521917\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olympus Rangers</strong> throws players into intense strategic battles where creativity, preparation, and smart decision-making define every outcome. Players will train and evolve powerful creatures known as <strong>Olys</strong>, shaping them into unique fighters and pushing their strategies to the limit in a competitive system designed to deliver depth and replayability<strong> like never before</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will be able to build their perfect team from <strong>60 fully customizable Olys</strong>, adjusting their stats, moves, passive abilities, and equipping modifiers to create endless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/910f74289189b66cfe51091977a3d004.avif?t=1783521917\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>Olympus Rangers</strong> goes a step further with full <strong><i>Steam Workshop</i></strong> integration for creating and sharing mods. Players will be able to create their own Olys in both 2D and 3D. The goal is to give the community the tools to showcase their creativity and expand the Olympus in their own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/2fdd0f79ce13a0993afeebc7e4edb421.avif?t=1783521917\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>👉 discord .gg/  cUUSsFKKaR👈</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/ddd126a75acbb1dda730fb7ff3aaae67.avif?t=1783521917\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/47ae47ec00d841c88c49b7c45864b305.avif?t=1783521917\" width=621 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Welcome to the ranger system! I'll be your guide throughout the Steam page. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, I'll give you a rundown of your basic moves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shooting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy, you can shoot bullets sideways.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mint can shoot them vertically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plum shoots them back and forth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lastly, Lemon’s bullets can clear diagonal formations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Melee attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537b3ff119cf4386e7746.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537b3ff119cf4386e7746.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537b3ff119cf4386e7746.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your weapon is not merely a gun! Parry or hook to special objects to advance through the levels!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jump, Dash and Brake</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/54fb872de50dc1cabbc792a1f110d0fb.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/54fb872de50dc1cabbc792a1f110d0fb.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/54fb872de50dc1cabbc792a1f110d0fb.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Jump over obstacles, dash to go faster or brake if you're feeling overwhelmed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's go over every reward you can earn on each level now. They are as follow: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/09117e59d9aa265afa7f943ed9427144.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/09117e59d9aa265afa7f943ed9427144.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/09117e59d9aa265afa7f943ed9427144.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Score 5 stars ranks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be ranked based on your performance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to break the chain or get hit as that will hurt your ranking!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/7be9f6b1ce4f75018295d111111f001b.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/7be9f6b1ce4f75018295d111111f001b.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/7be9f6b1ce4f75018295d111111f001b.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get a memory picture every time you clear a level with a high score! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranger Medals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/59bc7175f774d0d2dedff78cd681ef02.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/59bc7175f774d0d2dedff78cd681ef02.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/59bc7175f774d0d2dedff78cd681ef02.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find ranger medals! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They unlock levels and sometimes even boss encounters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's about it! I'll let you discover everything else as you go! Good luck! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 20 playable levels with its secret paths.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 playable characters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of different enemies and stages, each taking place in a different time of day!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 bosses to fight, and a final fight across the entire map!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split your team to take on 2 paths at the same time!<br>Take on hard mode. You'll receive twice the time penalty for each hit you take. Become untouchable!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inky Mode! Once you beat the game, you will unlock new modes to play. Inky can shoot in all directions. Everything goes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the game to try the arcade mode. Can you beat every level without taking a break?</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/47ae47ec00d841c88c49b7c45864b305.avif?t=1783521917\" width=621 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Welcome to the ranger system! I'll be your guide throughout the Steam page. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, I'll give you a rundown of your basic moves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shooting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.poster.avif?t=1783521917\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.webm?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/e5ec217995973c95d523f65db3b91f35.mp4?t=1783521917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy, you can shoot bullets sideways.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mint can shoot them vertically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plum shoots them back and forth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lastly, Lemon’s bullets can clear diagonal formations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Melee attack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787680/extras/c78d8515b55537